@startuml mill-desktop
title Desktop mill
left to right direction
rectangle "Electron mill\napp" as Mill
rectangle "Stratum pool" as Pool
rectangle "DATUM Gateway" as Gw
rectangle "Node" as Node
rectangle "DATUM Prime" as Prime
Mill --> Pool : TCP Stratum
Mill --> Gw : TCP Stratum
Mill --> Node : RPC
Gw --> Node : GBT submitblock
Gw --> Prime : DATUM
note bottom of Mill
  No WSS required.
  Host a pool stays Prime spawn.
end note
@enduml
